# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow these specific files/directories
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!commands/
!commands/**
!agents/
!agents/**
!skills/
!skills/**

# Omarchy-provided skills, symlinked from /usr/share/omarchy on this machine only.
skills/diagnose-crash
skills/omarchy

# Skills synced in by Claude Code itself (managed state, not user-authored).
skills/synced/
!statusline-command.sh
!README.md
